  data: {
    LLM: 'Attack with low cards (6s, 7s, 8s). Save trumps for defense or critical attacks. Never attack with a trump unless you need to.\n\nCard Counting: Track which trump ranks have been played. In Podkidnoy, use passing strategically to offload the attack to a player with fewer cards.\n\nEndgame: Once the stock is empty, you know all remaining cards in the game. Calculate whether to attack aggressively to push remaining cards onto opponents or defend conservatively.',
